name: bnb
displayName: Blood & Banner
subtitle: "Vexillum Sanguinis Nostri"
description:
'''
>Oderint Dum Metuant



Inspired by the historical YouTube videos about medieval battles with tabletop graphics

This mod is about controlling unit battalions in medieval age with semi-historical/sandbox style like TABS

There's minimal logistical part, most of the focus is on the combat

Very janky due to Mindustry not being intended to be played like this



Special thanks to D&X for ideas and maps



WIP
'''
author: Fitz
minGameVersion: 154
version: 0.3
hideBrowser: true
java: false
//dependencies: ["multi-crafter"]



